{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>That he hire him</b> — it is a למען-clause, and the meaning is that the prophecy is a למען-clause, namely that he was hired." "<b>That I fear and do so</b> — that I enter the temple." "<b>And I sin</b> — against Him." "<b>To them for an evil name</b> — upon me, that I shut the doors." "<b>That they reproach me</b> — that I feared them and hid."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:13.183598518Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}